  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme dedicated to enhance capacity of workers which focuses on youth and climate change to ensure a just transition towards environmentally sustainable economies and societies for all. It is based on identification of gaps in trade union strengths and service provision and areas where trade unions have had challenges in influencing policies.</narrative>
  </description>
